# Python bytecode (the supermassive engine is source, never bytecode)
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Compiled objects (night-cafe-1): raw binaries are never tracked in
# this repository - the tracked lane is the .gz package with its
# .b3sum sidecar (ebpf-prebuilt/), and the raw object is a local
# regeneration or extraction product. The fuzz seed corpora ride
# their own .secs suffix and stay tracked test vectors.
*.o
